{
  "id": "GEN.46",
  "number": "46",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Giing'Eeta 46",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "46",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 46"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "46",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo gawa ng'eanyiida Misri sea fugeaba gheanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghang'eat Israeli gawa bareanyeakaaschi sea haleanjeadaanyi sean mideawa, ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Beer-sheba, ak ghoadaw ASEETA Isaka was ghwaan lukghumajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobalool ASEETA Israeli aba giirgweatka eawa, ak gwayeesha, “Yakobo, Yakobo.” Ak gwayeesha, “Aniini geandi hiji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Aniini geawooschi ASEETA, ASEETA ghweandaang'u; adiidu giiwali beata ng'eanyiida Misri; aba gideaba gaydanung' gwaheedu jeataang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajeeteayeena sea ang'iing'i ng'eanyiida Misri, ak gaydabiikta deadeelneey ng'eang'i; ak eaweeda jea meawana gaygabunyi Yosefu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghabeawa Yakobo ng'eanyiida Beer-sheba; ak gageanu orjooga Israeli ghweanda nyaawa was Yakobo ea diibiga nyaawa, ea gadeemga nyaawa, ak ghwasar aba jeesinga mutukwajeega adayda Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaat eara dugwa nyaawa ea haleanjeeda nyaawa, ghayi nyas aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani, ak ghapka ng'eanyiida Misri, ak goodeanyi Yakobo sea jeacheangaaschi sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "orjoagaaschi sea orjoogeaba gaaschi, ea haweagaaschi ea haweega orjoagaaschi; ak gweadu jeacheangaaschi sean ng'eanyiida Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh gheawunga jeacheenga Israeli, buwa ng'eanyiida Misri, Yakobo gil sea orjoagaaschi. Rubeni, was duweacheeda Yakobo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Rubeni: ea Hanoki, ea Balu, ea Hesroni, ea Garmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Simeoni: Yemueli gil, ea Yamini, ea Ohadi, ea Yakini, ea Sohari, ea Shauli, was orjeeda gatmooda eemeeda Ganaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Lawi: Gershoni gil, ea Gohati ea Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yuda: Eri gil, ea Onani, ea Shela, ea Beresi, sea Sera (nea Eri ea Onani gameewiisa ng'eanyiida Ganaani); nea orjooga Beresi ea Hesroni gil ea Hamuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Isakari: Dola gil, ea Bufa, Iyobu, ea Shimroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Sebuluni: Seredi gil, ea Eloni ea Yaleeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Suh orjooga Leyahi, ghayi jiilsa Yakobo aba ng'eanyiida Badan-aramuhi ea hudaanyi siguura Dina; nea jeacheenga sean bea Leya ea diktam ea damasamwagu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Gadi: Sifioni gil, ea Hagi, ea Shuni, ea Esboni, ea Eri, ea Arodi sea Areli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Asheri: Imnahi, ea Ishfa, ea Ishfi, ea Beriya sea huda ghaamwat siguura Sera. Nea orjooga Beri: ea Heberi gil ea Malkieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Suh orju damwalah was jeacheenga Yakobo jih Silpahi, ghayi was gatmooda was soomjeanda adaw Labani hudaanyi was Leya). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Raheli, was gatmooda Yakobo: ea Yosefu gil ea Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yosefu aba ng'eanyiida Misri gwaji orju iyeenya nea Manase gil ea Efraimu, jiilsa Asena was hudeaba Botifera was ashoohoocheanda Oni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Benjamini ea: Bela gil, ea Bekari, ea Ashbeli, ea Gera, ea Naamani, ea Ehi, ea Roshi, ea Mupimu, ea Hupimu sea Arda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(suh orjooga Raheli, jiilsa Yakobohi ea damanang'wan sean). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dani gil sea orjeedaanyi was Hushimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Naftali: Yaseeli gil, ea Guni, ea Yaseri sea Shilemu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(suh orjooga Bilha gil, ghayi adaw Labani hudaanyi was Raheli, ak gwajiilsa Yakobo orju ispwa). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buuneesean bea Yakobo weay ng'eanyiida Misri was jeacheangaaschi nea meekuuyi gadeemga orjoagaaschi ea laadam ea lah; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea orjooga Yosefu, sijiilsa niny aba ng'eanyiida Misri, ea iyeenya; buuneesean bea gheeh Yakobo, buwa ng'eanyiida Misri, ea laadam ea damanamughuush.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo sea fugeaba gheanyi aba ng'eanyiida Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu goojeakta Yuda goosheeda gawa heeda Yosefu gwayeesha eeroonyeesiina ng'eanyiida Gosheni; ak ghwahidu ng'eanyiida Gosheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu Yosefu mutukoadaanyi ak gawa gwaroonyi ghweandaanyi was Israeli aba Gosheni; ak gwarukusa geaw, ak goobissa gheata ghwaan ak gooyeawda ea gageawiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Israeli ak gwayeesha Yosefu, “Asi ghamneawa eara dami, iinaadaayi gheanyangaagu nea ghaanali gideaba guduwoosa majeek.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yosefu orjooga ghaamwat sea fuga adeana ghwaan bea gheanyaawa, “Gaydawa darukusa Farao, ak geayeeshi niny, ‘Orjoogiyya ea fuga ghaheanya ghayi mida ng'eanyiida Ganaani, nupka heedeanyu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea buuneeda ea fuga dugwa gil, aba gideaba fuga weama dugwa; ak gweadu nooga nyaawa, ea haleanjeeda nyaawa sean mideawa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
